  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Cooperation Facility 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Regional Cooperation Facility aim to facilitate activities accompanying policy dialogue and when relevant political dialogue, capacity building, strategic communication, public diplomacy[1] and the efficient implementation of programmes at regional, multi-country level in Latin America and the Caribbean, as well as in Latin America countries without a MIP. [1] Chile, Panama and Uruguay only, possibly Venezuela</narrative>
  </description>
